# Testnet Demo: What Needs to Change

Analysis of all mocked/simulated components in the ZK-RFQ PoC and what's required to run a demo with a real wallet on a testnet, with observable transactions.

---

## Current Mocking Inventory

| # | Component | Current State | File(s) |
|---|-----------|--------------|---------|
| 1 | **DEX Price Feeds** | Random jitter around hardcoded base prices | [main.rs](file:///Users/aeres/Desktop/projects/zk-rfq/solver/src/main.rs#L430-L465) |
| 2 | **Noir ZK Proof** | SHA256 hash of witness data (fake proof) | [main.rs](file:///Users/aeres/Desktop/projects/zk-rfq/solver/src/main.rs#L497-L513) |
| 3 | **Wallet / Signing** | Hardcoded hex strings as addresses, no signing | [terminal.tsx](file:///Users/aeres/Desktop/projects/zk-rfq/frontend/pages/terminal.tsx#L25-L27) |
